          "kind": "user",
          "reference": "user-confirmed"
        }
      ],
      "status": "verified",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-08T01:14:27Z",
      "value": "Gateway is the HTTP edge and calls typed upstream clients without accessing Identity storage. Identity owns identity domain behavior and persistence. Knowledge owns document metadata, permissions, publication/public projections, attachments, trash, quotas, and outbox in the PostgreSQL knowledge schema, but not Yjs binary state. Collaboration is the Rust Volo Thrift and WebSocket/Yrs service; it owns collaboration state in its PostgreSQL schema and rechecks document access through Knowledge RPC."
    },
